<InstitutionalPage
  title="Contact"
  eyebrow="Publication desk"
  description="Contact Nuvellum for editorial, corrections, business, advertising and rights enquiries."
  intro="Nuvellum currently routes publication enquiries through a single monitored desk while department-specific addresses are brought online."
  note="Current monitored publication address: sam@nuvellum.news"
>
  <h2>Editorial</h2>
  <p>For editorial questions, sourcing concerns or story-related correspondence, email <a href="mailto:sam@nuvellum.news?subject=Editorial%20enquiry">sam@nuvellum.news</a> with “Editorial enquiry” in the subject line.</p>
  <h2>Corrections</h2>
  <p>Correction requests should identify the article, the disputed passage and the factual basis for the requested change. Email <a href="mailto:sam@nuvellum.news?subject=Correction%20request">sam@nuvellum.news</a> or see the <a href="/corrections">corrections policy</a>.</p>
  <h2>Business, advertising and rights</h2>
  <p>For commercial, sponsorship, partnership or rights enquiries, email <a href="mailto:sam@nuvellum.news?subject=Business%20enquiry">sam@nuvellum.news</a> with a short description of the request.</p>
</InstitutionalPage>
